Track page views, user identification, and custom events across multiple analytics providers. The analytics system is provider-agnostic, allowing you to integrate Google Analytics, Mixpanel, PostHog, or any custom service.

Read the [Analytics Overview](./analytics/analytics-and-events) to get started.

This is part of the [Next.js Drizzle SaaS Kit](/drizzle).